            "review_title": "Review at Luk Chew HongKong - Cha Chaan Teng",
            "review_text": "Sushi Salmon\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n1\nAverage restaurant\nSep 2019 • Couples\nI went this restaurant because of the decoration. But the food was not really suitable with my taste. I order 1 Dimsum, 1 fried noodle and 1 chicken legs, 1 fried veget.\nHonestly none of this is delicous. Everything is average. The order of the food makes a little bit difficult to understand. When i almost finish almost 3 dishes, the fried veget is served. I left a lots food but no one ask me why.\n\nThe drinks is much better. The decoration quite attractive and the service is friendly.\nRead more\nWritten September 19, 2019",
