            "review_title": "Review at Luk Chew HongKong - Cha Chaan Teng",
            "review_text": "M4683PCjoe\nPretoria, South Africa19 contributions\n0\nMarvelous food in clean bright environment\nJun 2017 • Couples\nWe happened upon this restaurant tramping the streets for somewhere that looked \"safe\" to eat. This place was that and so much more. Wide range of food with wonderful flavours and all well presented. We had the Peking duck along with several extras. All were good, fresh and tasty. \nStaff were friendly and attentive. Strongly recommend a visit. More Chinese than Vietnamese, but we needed a change after 10 days here.\nRead more\nWritten June 21, 2017",
